## 13. Naming Conventions (Python)

| Element | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Variables, functions, methods | snake_case | `find_by_email`, `is_active`, `employee_id` |
| Classes | PascalCase | `EmployeeService`, `CreateEmployeeUseCase` |
| Constants | SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_PAGE_SIZE`, `DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` |
| Modules / files | snake_case | `employee_service.py`, `create_employee.py` |
| Private attributes | leading underscore | `_session`, `_repo` |

